      "content": "it’s just... the \"shaping the story\" thing... it sounds so exhausting. i don't have the strength to shape anything anymore. every day is just another cycle of scavenging, hiding from the drones, and trying not to starve. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just... stop everything. do you ever think that maybe some things aren't meant to be fixed?",
